        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SALT </strong>is a fast-paced laser-tag shooter where your agility and aim will be put to the test. Play single player or online with bots and/or other players across unique maps using parkour abilities and a varied arsenal of weapons you will discover during a match. Every battle will challenge your reaction time, positioning, and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204850/extras/89ee64d6832b33a5fe69538cb9805f32.avif?t=1767068107\" width=844 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your mode:<br>• <strong>Elimination</strong> – Two teams compete to reach 15 kills first.<br>• <strong>Domination</strong> – Capture control points and try to hold them down.<br>• <strong>Capture the Flag</strong> – Delicately balance defending your flag whilst trying to capture the enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong><br>• Team-based competitive gameplay<br>• Multiple game modes (Elimination, Domination, CTF)<br>• Parkour abilities for high-mobility combat<br>• Weapon pickups and loadout variety<br>• Designed for replayability and skill expression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arena isn’t just where you fight, it’s your home. Master the movement. Control the map. Outplay everyone.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SALT </strong>is a fast-paced laser-tag shooter where your agility and aim will be put to the test. Play single player or online with bots and/or other players across unique maps using parkour abilities and a varied arsenal of weapons you will discover during a match. Every battle will challenge your reaction time, positioning, and teamwork.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4204850/extras/89ee64d6832b33a5fe69538cb9805f32.avif?t=1767068107\" width=844 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your mode:<br>• <strong>Elimination</strong> – Two teams compete to reach 15 kills first.<br>• <strong>Domination</strong> – Capture control points and try to hold them down.<br>• <strong>Capture the Flag</strong> – Delicately balance defending your flag whilst trying to capture the enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong><br>• Team-based competitive gameplay<br>• Multiple game modes (Elimination, Domination, CTF)<br>• Parkour abilities for high-mobility combat<br>• Weapon pickups and loadout variety<br>• Designed for replayability and skill expression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The arena isn’t just where you fight, it’s your home. Master the movement. Control the map. Outplay everyone.</p>",
